**cachet** is mainly a ^^LITERARY CRITICS' WORD^^ (bears the c. of genius &c.), & should be expelled as an alien; *stamp*, *seal*, *sign manual*, are good enough for English readers. See ^^FRENCH WORDS^^; &, for synonymy, ^^SIGN^^.
